            <ArticleTitle>Isolated torsion of the fallopian tube as differential diagnosis to acute abdominal pain in a thirteen years old girl.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1397-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of isolated torsion of the Fallopian tube in a thirteen years old girl. Only because of laparoscopy, the diagnosis was determined. Torsion of the fallopian tube as a differential diagnosis to acute abdomen is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
